      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/MacDonough_Monument%2C_City_Hall_Place%2C_Plattsburgh%2C_NY_%2853691545691%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MacDonough_Monument,_City_Hall_Place,_Plattsburgh,_NY_(53691545691).jpg",
